{"nodes": [{"id": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_acoes", "label": "Feature: A\u00e7\u00f5es (cat\u00e1logo global de pap\u00e9is)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/acoes/spec.md", "source_location": "L1-L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cat\u00e1logo global: cadastrar j\u00e1 busca a cota\u00e7\u00e3o na fonte do mercado; ticker inexistente na fonte n\u00e3o vira cadastro. Nenhuma cota\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 ao vivo, ent\u00e3o toda cota\u00e7\u00e3o carrega o hor\u00e1rio em que foi obtida."}, {"id": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_us_012", "label": "US-012 \u2014 Cadastrar a\u00e7\u00e3o por ticker e mercado", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/acoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_us_013", "label": "US-013 \u2014 Consultar o cat\u00e1logo de a\u00e7\u00f5es", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/acoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_us_014", "label": "US-014 \u2014 Saber o qu\u00e3o atual est\u00e1 a cota\u00e7\u00e3o", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/acoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_us_015", "label": "US-015 \u2014 Excluir a\u00e7\u00e3o do cat\u00e1logo", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/acoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_defasagem_de_cotacao", "label": "Defasagem de cota\u00e7\u00e3o por mercado", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/acoes/spec.md", "source_location": "L83-L114", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O limiar sai do atraso caracter\u00edstico de cada fonte (30 min BR, 5 min US), n\u00e3o do hor\u00e1rio de preg\u00e3o \u2014 fora do preg\u00e3o tudo estoura o limiar, e por isso a defasagem geral vira um aviso \u00fanico no cabe\u00e7alho em vez de um por linha. A defasagem \u00e9 calculada na tela comparando o hor\u00e1rio da cota\u00e7\u00e3o com o hor\u00e1rio atual; n\u00e3o h\u00e1 campo de frescor no backend."}, {"id": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_atualizacao_de_cotacao_por_comparacao_de_horario", "label": "Detec\u00e7\u00e3o de atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o por compara\u00e7\u00e3o de hor\u00e1rio", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/acoes/spec.md", "source_location": "L104-L114", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O endpoint responde com sucesso mesmo quando a fonte cai, devolvendo a \u00faltima cota\u00e7\u00e3o conhecida \u2014 a \u00fanica forma de saber se atualizou \u00e9 comparar o dataHoraCotacao antes e depois. N\u00e3o atualizou vira aviso, n\u00e3o erro de tela inteira."}, {"id": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_ticker_como_rotulo_do_papel", "label": "Ticker como r\u00f3tulo do papel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/acoes/spec.md", "source_location": "L76-L81", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O nome da empresa vem sempre nulo da API, ent\u00e3o o ticker \u00e9 o identificador vis\u00edvel e nenhuma tela reserva espa\u00e7o (nem travess\u00e3o) para um nome que nunca vai existir."}], "edges": [{"source": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_acoes", "target": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_us_012", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".spec/features/acoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_acoes", "target": "_spec_features_acoes_spec_us_013", "relation"